{"product_id":"the-baby-book-how-to-enjoy-year-one","title":"The Baby Book: How to Enjoy Year One","description":"\u003cp\u003eAn experienced maternity nurse and mother offers practical advice on coping with your baby‰۪s first year.Rachel Waddilove has worked for many years as a private maternity nurse; her clients include Gwyneth Paltrow. In this book, she draws on her considerable professional and personal experience to advise young parents on everything they need to know about looking after a baby in its first year. Areas covered include: needs for the nursery, coming home from hospital, breast feeding vs bottle feeding, establishing a routine, sleep, crying, and introducing solid food. In addition to the host of practical information given, Rachel also considers the emotional and social aspects of becoming a parent.Rachel‰۪s down-to-earth style and wealth of experience makes this an essential guide for new parents, expectant parents, and all who want the best care for their children.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 203\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Rachel Waddilove\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780745952130\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 192\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45145462472857,"sku":"5RA9780745952130","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67ad828cde01d_The_20Baby_20Book-_20How_20to_20Enjoy_20Year_20One_20Rachel_20Waddilove.jpg?v=1739466675","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-baby-book-how-to-enjoy-year-one","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}